# 引用のための情報（GitHub の「Cite this repository」に使われる）。版番号・DOI・URL は data/release.json と同じにする
# （scripts/check_release.py が確かめる）。DOI が発行されたら doi: を、リリースの日が決まったら date-released: を足す。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Sheneset: A Digital TEI Edition of the Nag Hammadi Codices"
abstract: >-
  A TEI P5 corpus and website for the Coptic texts of the Nag Hammadi Codices
  (NHC I–XIII): morpheme-level annotation (lemma and part of speech), a Coptic
  lexicon with Japanese, English and French senses, Japanese, English and
  French translations, parallel passages, and the full text of the codices as
  working files (39 tractates with a draft automatic annotation that has not
  been checked by hand). The Coptic texts and the Greek text of Plato's
  Republic (OCT/Burnet) are in the public domain; the data and texts created by
  the project are released under CC BY 4.0, the source code under the MIT
  License.
authors:
